<p>Ideal para organizaciones que operan continuamente o cuentan con procesos cr\u00edticos que no pueden detenerse.<\/p>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"sap-section-dark\">\r\n    <h3>Servicios AMS SAP<\/h3>\r\n    <p>Permiten administrar y evolucionar el entorno SAP mediante un enfoque integral y continuo.<\/p>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-eb67924 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-min-height elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-items-middle\" data-id=\"eb67924\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-wide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-6c2b661\" data-id=\"6c2b661\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7ba51bb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7ba51bb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2><b>Beneficios del soporte SAP para empresas mexicanas<\/b><\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d2848dc elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"d2848dc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"sap-247\">\r\n  <style>\r\n    \/* Estilos base del contenedor *\/\r\n    .sap-247 {\r\n      font-size: 14px;\r\n      color: #000000;\r\n      line-height: 1.5;\r\n      max-width: 800px;\r\n      margin: 0 auto;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .sap-247 p {\r\n      color: #000000;\r\n      margin: 0 0 1e